      "content": "it's not just a chapter though. it's not 'temporary'. the person who could soar, the person who had purpose... that person is gone. and what's left? just this broken equipment. i look at my limbs and they don't feel like mine anymore. they just feel like a burden. like i'm just dragging around a corpse that hasn't realized it's dead yet. why am i supposed to 'rebuild' something that was never meant to exist without the talent? it feels like i'm just haunting my own life. does that even make sense to keep going when the essence is just",
